 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Cui with a preposition",
     "texto": [
      "**in cui** (in which), **di cui** (of which), **a cui** (to which), **con cui** (with which).",
      "Example: **La città in cui vivo** (the city in which I live). **Il libro di cui parli** (the book you are talking about)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Relative with a preposition",
     "texto": [
      "At this level it is worth mastering **preposition + cui**. **Il quale/la quale** also exists, agreeing in gender and number, and usually sounds more formal; it is not necessary to build the examples in this unit."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
